{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫台慶圓滿落幕，最近因在籃球賽表現出色而爆紅的劉穎鏇，前晚使出一招「奪命鉸剪腳」俘虜網民，她有份參與的動作表演更獲推為「全晚最好睇環節」，獲讚打得又睇得！</p><p>何沛珈則同人唔同命，雖然在賽跑中包尾捧盃，但遭質疑「假跑」搶Fo而被嘲「心機女」。</p><p>&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T19:24:23.643552+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T19:01:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T19:17:34.966966+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T19:17:34.966966+00:00","content_hash":"c3a8994f2b1d93250b2fd56149802f415f61874ae216257813794134fecae2a4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}